      "Young adults are aware of the risks of noise-induced hearing damage and are motivated to protect their hearing.",
      "The demand for hearing protection among young adults is growing, particularly at music events.",
      "Moldex-Metric has the technical expertise and manufacturing capabilities to produce high-quality earplugs or noise-canceling solutions."
